    "detailed_description": "Experience a new take on the party game genre with Mapstermind\u2019s array of cute characters, two unique game boards with exciting mechanics, and one evil pair of floating hands!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/d52f7664a8b460e0b79842929b67bd50.poster.avif?t=1652799193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/d52f7664a8b460e0b79842929b67bd50.webm?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/d52f7664a8b460e0b79842929b67bd50.mp4?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Character</h2>Pick from 9 uniquely adorable Piecelings or don the white gloves of the Mapster!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/b0e2e0739c90a97abacfaf812f87a92b.poster.avif?t=1652799193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/b0e2e0739c90a97abacfaf812f87a92b.webm?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/b0e2e0739c90a97abacfaf812f87a92b.mp4?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Complete Cooperative Tasks As the Piecelings</h2>Be a giant clam\u2019s stylist, catch a home run, bring a mermaid her crown, and much more!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/9c1bfe71841918c98ab1bde24f873d3c.poster.avif?t=1652799193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/9c1bfe71841918c98ab1bde24f873d3c.webm?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/9c1bfe71841918c98ab1bde24f873d3c.mp4?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash the Mapster\u2019s Devastating Attacks</h2>Utilize the Mapster\u2019s custom control board to set traps and launch attacks to delay the Piecelings!  <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/95f6de1dade5e995f90e052d58bd26f3.poster.avif?t=1652799193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/95f6de1dade5e995f90e052d58bd26f3.webm?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/95f6de1dade5e995f90e052d58bd26f3.mp4?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete On Two Unique Game Boards</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">City</h2>Take a tour of the city and explore its many famous landmarks.  Avoid the hustle and bustle of this urban environment and return order to the city!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seafloor</h2>In this underwater stage, Piecelings help the Mermaid recover her lost items. Beware of the sea life and other aquatic hazards!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/867947d2f3f1503e68adf0fb8cfda906.poster.avif?t=1652799193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/867947d2f3f1503e68adf0fb8cfda906.webm?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950250/extras/867947d2f3f1503e68adf0fb8cfda906.mp4?t=1652799193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
